# sabotage=NoCallWrites with check=KeepGoing beside the check: the place is printed once and the run goes on to its end
# FORM: AsRead
# RUN: run-in-shell
# OPTIONS: check=MovedLoads,KeepGoing disable=pass:UnrollShortLoops sabotage=NoCallWrites
# CHECK: AOT claim check: LoadMayMove
# CHECK-NOT: AOT claim check
# CHECK: exited with 0
# PROGRAM-OF: no-call-writes-left-alone.ir
